{"steam_appid":1968710,"steam_name":"MEATGRINDER","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1968710/525153/305f21b0e910327d75dd45ba11845e983af9a89b/1751062412/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1672069492","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256922890/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1672069492","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/ss_0dca569fab7c39df0d4d92acf6fb8f27647099ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1697706749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/ss_ab5d110fed99c5b06f03e90a845547f2efbabd32.1920x1080.jpg?t=1697706749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/ss_67cad49c77e3b6f5514364d28a6d7cf35a38c81a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1697706749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/ss_345aa7a49cb1c738ab5a00a2ac20379780edcded.1920x1080.jpg?t=1697706749","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/ss_c4b5894629d4f102ba64278d594edbef20347817.1920x1080.jpg?t=1697706749"],"about_the_game":"Meatgrinder is a high-octane epic FPS. No cutscenes or storylines, just pure action. It's like if Clustertruck met Duke Nukem.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVING ENVIRONMENT</h2>Constantly moving environment won't let you rest for a second<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/f9da3b967647e73c73b734506d3869e9.poster.avif?t=1697706749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/f9da3b967647e73c73b734506d3869e9.webm?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/f9da3b967647e73c73b734506d3869e9.mp4?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST-PACED GAMEPLAY</h2>The game is really fast. You'll have to master your movement - jump, dodge and annihilate enemies before they even see you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/d457b69ecc4b2e25b61596f208afcf68.poster.avif?t=1697706749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/d457b69ecc4b2e25b61596f208afcf68.webm?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/d457b69ecc4b2e25b61596f208afcf68.mp4?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC AND INSANE</h2>Jump your way through insane levels on top of speeding trucks, trains and planes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/6ba113693412ddb5e498bb53677b9fc1.poster.avif?t=1697706749\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/6ba113693412ddb5e498bb53677b9fc1.webm?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1968710/extras/6ba113693412ddb5e498bb53677b9fc1.mp4?t=1697706749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU @ 2+ GHz, 4 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron